      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 54: 🔴 `merge_binaries()` now runs `lipo` as `$($COMMAND)`, which is command substitution, not command execution. This executes `COMMAND`, captures its stdout, and then tries to execute that output as a shell command. `lipo` normally prints nothing on success, so this can fail with an empty-command error and breaks multi-arch merge. Replace with direct execution (`$COMMAND`) or safer `eval \"$COMMAND\"`/array-based invocation.",
      "revId": "ff7ed25846525e5ed976a4183917987e0b495a02",
